Z||000010||ChadMan||03-18-2001||09:43 AM||||Because, FOR THE MONEY, nothing else comes close to the Fiero driving experience.<P>Miatas are too small.  Camaros/Firebirds are too big.  Mustangs (pre-94) rust and have lousy brakes.  Gen-1 MR2's rust.  Gen-2 MR2's cost too much.  Porsche 944's cost too much to fix.  And I don't like the way FWD cars handle, so that eliminates lots of otherwise fun cars like the CRX/Civic Si, 16v Corollas, Ford Probe, etc.||||reg||1
